# A division with a Float operand is true division: 7 / 2.0 is 3.5, though
# 7 / 2 truncates to 3. One Float operand is enough.
#= {result: [3.5, 3.5, -3.5, 3], inputs: {seven: 7, two: 2, two_float: 2.0, seven_float: 7.0}}
[
    seven / two_float,
    seven_float / two,
    -seven / two_float,
    seven / two,
]
